


MKDIR(1)            UNIX Programmer's Manual             MKDIR(1)



NAME
     mkdir - make a directory

SYNOPSIS
     mkdir dirname ...

DESCRIPTION
     _M_k_d_i_r creates specified directories in mode 777.  Standard
     entries, `.', for the directory itself, and `..' for its
     parent, are made automatically.

     _M_k_d_i_r requires write permission in the parent directory.

SEE ALSO
     rmdir(1)








































